LocalAI paged serving hooks for llama.cpp's server.

Admission, preemption with resume by recompute, and a decode-first prefill
budget over the unified KV cache. The policy is in serving_policy.h, which
prepare.sh copies next to server-context.cpp. Every hook runs only when
common_params::paged_serving is set, or prefill_budget > 0 for the budget.
See backend/cpp/llama-cpp/PATCHES.md before re-porting this patch.

